Pull the images of the `container.docker` and `container.podman` resources
on this node while it does not run them, so a failover to it finds them in
the store of the engine.

This is the default of the resources of the node: the `image_prefetch`
keyword of a resource overrides it. Set in the cluster configuration, it
is the default of every node not setting its own.

See the `image_prefetch` keyword of the container resources for what is
pulled, and when.
